  "scope": "A separate review copy. SIM12 counts nonzero effective projections by the existing half-count theorem. SIM13 is a coupled proof replacement, preserving an autonomous compressed argument including incompatible homogeneous sources, normalized-centre injectivity and the separate two-block clause. The four removed equation labels occurred only inside the removed original proof; they are not result labels and are not reused. Two numbered blocks receive explicit inherited conventions; the other165 blocks are unchanged. Existing index and replica clarifications are not duplicated. No new exponent is claimed in a numbered statement, and all previous packages remain preserved. Palomar remains on hold."
